description	"Nomi Sunrider

A passive master of the Force, who uses team buffs, controlling powers and lifting saber strikes.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (3)
-- 350% more special damage
-- Blinds/Lifts On Hit
-- EX Saber Throw (2)
--- 33% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Push (3)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (3)
- Mindtrick (1)
- Sever Force (Drain 2) ^3[CS3]
- Blind ^3[CS2]
- Team Energize (3) ^3[CS4]
- Absorb (2)

^8Attributes:
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Force Block/Focus (2)
- 50% Faster Cooldowns
- Blast Armor
- Stat Viewer

^8Abilities:
- Dash (1) ^3[CS1]
- Educate (Force Dispenser 3) ^3[USE In Melee]"